000053C          05  System-Record-Version-Prime      binary-char.
000054C          05  System-Record-Version-Secondary  binary-char.
000055C          05  Vat-Rates                    comp.
000056C              07 Vat-Rate-1   pic 99v99.   *> Standard rate
000057C              07 Vat-Rate-2   pic 99v99.   *> Reduced rate
000058C              07 Vat-Rate-3   pic 99v99.   *> Minimal or exempt
000059C              07 Vat-Rate-4   pic 99v99.   *> 2b used for local sales tax   Not UK
