000784  *> Terminal-Sizing.
000785  *>
000786       perform  forever
000787                accept   WS-Env-Lines   from lines
000788                if       WS-Env-Lines < 28
000789                         display  SY010    at 0101 with erase eos
000790                         accept   WS-Reply at 0133
000791                         move     8 to WS-Term-Code
000792                         exit perform cycle
000793                end-if
000794                accept   WS-Env-Columns from Columns
000795                if       WS-Env-Columns < 80
000796                         display  SY013    at 0101 with erase eos
000797                         accept   WS-Reply at 0130
000798                         move     8 to WS-Term-Code
000799                         exit perform cycle
000800                end-if
000801       end-perform.
000802  *>
000803  *> Set up error message areas on screen - assumes terninal set for => 28 deep
000804  *>  and must be 80 wide   BUT only needs depth of 24 or more.
000805  *>
000806       subtract 2 from WS-Env-Lines giving WS-22-Lines.
000807       subtract 1 from WS-Env-Lines giving WS-23-Lines.
000808       move     WS-Env-Lines to WS-Lines.
000809       move     zero         to WS-Term-Code.
000810       initialise
000811                WS-Account-Table
000812                WS-Presets
000813                WS-Accumulators-2
000814                WS-Accumulators-1.
