000821  *>
000822       open     input PY-Param1-File.
000823       if       PY-PR1-Status not = "00"      *> Does not exist yet so lets create it & write rec
000824                perform  ZZ040-Evaluate-Message
000825                display  PY001         at line WS-23-Lines col 1 foreground-color 4 erase eos
000826                display  PY-PR1-Status at line WS-23-Lines col 47
000827                display  WS-Eval-Msg   at line WS-23-Lines col 50
000828                display  SY001         at line WS-Lines    col 1 foreground-color 2
000829                accept   WS-Reply      at line WS-Lines    col 48 AUTO
000830                close    PY-Param1-File
000831                move     1 to WS-Term-Code
000832                goback   returning 1        *> == no param file
000833       end-if.
