001208  *>***********************************
001209  *>      Accumulate pay info
001210  *>
001211  *> This routine will accumulate the pay-amt & Units that has just been read in.
001212  *>
001213  *> Accumulation is based on the value of the PAY.REPORTING.CAT% variable.
001214  *> Note that there is no rate zero, but all other VALID rates are accumulated.
001215  *>
001216       evaluate Pay-Reporting-Cat
001217       when = 1  add     Pay-Units to WS-Units (1)
001218                 add     Pay-Amt   to WS-Reg-Wages
001219  *>
001220       when = 2 or = 3 or = 4
001221                 add         Pay-Units to WS-Units (Pay-Reporting-Cat)
001222                 add     Pay-Amt   to WS-Other-Earn
001223
001224       when = 5  add     Pay-Units to WS-Vac-Taken
001225       when = 6  add     Pay-Units to WS-SL-Taken
001226       when = 7  add     Pay-Units to WS-Comp-Taken
001227       when = 8  add     Pay-Units to WS-Comp-Earned
001228       when = 9 or = 11 or = 12 or = 13 or = 14 or = 15 or = 17
001229                 add     Pay-Amt   to WS-Other-Earn
001230       when = 10 add     Pay-Amt   to WS-Tips
001231       when = 16 add     Pay-Amt   to WS-EIC
001232       when = 18 add     Pay-Amt   to WS-Tips
001233                                      WS-Tips-Reported
001234                                      WS-Other-Ded
001235
001236       when = 20 or = 28
001237                 add     Pay-Amt   to WS-FWT
001238       when = 21 or = 29
001239                 add     Pay-Amt   to WS-SWT
001240       when = 22 or = 30
001241                 add     Pay-Amt   to WS-LWT
001242       when = 23 or = 31
001243                 add     Pay-Amt   to WS-FICA
001244       when = 24 add     Pay-Amt   to WS-SDI
001245       when = 27 add     Pay-Amt   to WS-Other-Ded
001246       when = 33 or 34 or 35 or 36 or 37
001247                 add     Pay-Amt   to WS-Sys (Pay-Reporting-Cat - 32)
001248                 if      Ded-Sys-Earn-Ded (Pay-Reporting-Cat - 32) = "E"
001249                         add  Pay-Amt  to WS-Other-Earn
